    "updated_at": "2021-09-05T15:17:52Z",
    "body": "I don't think this can really be defined as a \"must\", since the user agent can't always be sure what type a file on the filesystem is. It's possible to want to upload a file that's in a format the browser doesn't understand but the server will understand. I think local file picking concepts are too deep into platform-specific UI functionality to be stated as firm requirements.",
