    "created_at": "2021-09-06T11:04:34Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-09-06T11:04:34Z",
    "body": "Increasing the likelihood of said request being followed is what I'm requesting. Of course you would still need server validation and what not. [`excludeAcceptAllOption`](https://wicg.github.io/file-system-access/#dom-filepickeroptions-excludeacceptalloption ) from the File System Access API provides more guarantees. That but on the file input is what I am requesting. If that's unlikely to happen then that's fine. But I just felt like it was worth requesting.",
